    /// `NOT` (case-insensitive) excludes a term: `running NOT marathon` matches `running` but
    /// not `marathon`.; Wrap a phrase in double quotes to match the words in order: `"summer
    /// collection"`.; Negate a phrase with `NOT`: `NOT "out of stock"`.; Group with parentheses
    /// to combine operators: `(nike OR adidas) running`.; `ONEAR/n` (case-insensitive) matches
